[PrintTextModified Text:没想到淋浴房里已经有人捷足先登，<br>我顿时紧张起来。|#0202Adv13_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_21_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，是希罗呀。|#0202Adv13_Noah001| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

