@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚，你在这里做什……没什么。|#0202Adv13_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:话没说完，我就反应过来了。|#0202Adv13_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是里面那幅画吧。|#0202Adv13_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:你、你你、你在说什么呢？|#0202Adv13_Noah002| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:咻、咻……！|#0202Adv13_Noah003| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

