[PrintTextModified Text:看她想走进淋浴房，我立马抓住<br>她的手臂。|#0202Adv13_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Pensive1

