# Choice2-2-2

@RecordCorrectChoice Number:19

[PrintTextModified Text:把她带去了画室。|#0202Adv13_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_11_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:40 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:还问怎么了。<br>这里是不能画画的。|#0202Adv13_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:这里也不准画画吗？<br>真小气啊。|#0202Adv13_Noah005| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚无精打采地鼓起脸颊。|#0202Adv13_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不是因为小气。<br>我们不是一起找到了画画的地方吗。|#0202Adv13_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:唔～话是这么说啦……|#0202Adv13_Noah006| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:那个，希罗，诺亚我啊……|#0202Adv13_Noah007| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她欲言又止，最后闭上了嘴。<br>可能还是对我有点顾忌吧。|#0202Adv13_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:"（毕竟我打过她，尽管不是真心的。<br>　她肯定多多少少有些怕我）|#0202Adv13_Hiro008|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（虽然我也想让她随心所欲地画，<br>　可是现在不能这么说）|#0202Adv13_Hiro009|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:总而言之，要画画请在画室里画。<br>|#0202Adv13_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:……好吧。|#0202Adv13_Noah008| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（看来，哪怕态度强硬点也得带她走了。<br>　虽然会浪费点时间，<br>　不过到了画室马上回来，应该就没问题了）|#0202Adv13_Hiro011|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我牵起气鼓鼓的诺亚，向画室走去。<br>|#0202Adv13_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

